# title: Patrol the waypoints
# description: Walks to the waypoints a, b and c in turn, forever, and tells you if there is no way to one of them.
# Setup: move the robot to each place you want it to visit, face it the way it should look
# there and use Save here in the Waypoints tab: a, b and c. Start the program from anywhere.
use waypoint

fn visit name
  set steps = call waypoint.go_face name
  if steps < 0
    chat "No way to " + name
  wait 30

forever
  call visit "a"
  call visit "b"
  call visit "c"
